WEBVTT

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.060
Mister... He fell off, maybe he's dead.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.720
I'm not sure about that.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.420
Just like always, I'm sure
he'll pop up somewhere.

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.270
I think so too!

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.290
I'm sure that he's still alive.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:14.170
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:14.170
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:21.670
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:21.670
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:30.780
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:30.780
With our eyes on the future

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:36.880
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:36.880
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:46.520
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:46.520
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:54.040
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:54.040
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:59.740
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:59.740
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:09.250
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:09.250
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.930
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.360
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:31.040
The young girl they met on
the Subway, Lou Lupus...

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:36.250
And the enemy who destroyed
her world, Omega...

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:42.450
Fate calls the lost travelers to the next stop.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.780
Mr. Kaze!

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.450
Sniff, sniff... Sniff, sniff, sniff...

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.450
Sniff, sniff...

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.480
Sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff...

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:09.380
Lou!

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:12.290
I told you that you don't want
to be looking for a guy like him!

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:16.720
While you were fighting so hard,
he just stood there and watched.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.690
Kaze probably couldn't care less
about what happens to us.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:28.360
But he went out of his way to save us all.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.760
The truth is that he is really a very nice guy.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.210
I understand.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:38.280
Now it's my turn to save you, Mr. Kaze.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:44.340
I owe you my life, and from now on
I will use it to burn, burn...

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.650
And burn for you!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.990
Lou, are you all right?!

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.530
It is definitely true that the only
reason we are able to be here today

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.520
is because he fought for us.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.460
He probably has his own reasoning.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.500
His standards are just different than ours.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:18.320
Mr. Kaze!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:26.460
This dish is a hot salad of slightly boiled
and peeled Malboro tentacles,

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:30.060
dressed with Buri insect oil.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:35.470
Fresh and lively.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:44.880
Makenshi, I heard a nasty rumor
that the Black Wind is still alive.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:46.610
What...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.240
...is going on?

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.940
As far as that is concerned,
trust me to take care of it.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.040
You annoying, stupid fish!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.670
You should stay back at the bottom
of the ocean where you belong.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.840
Eww, it stinks like salt!

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:23.880
It sure did take you a long time to make your
adjustments to the Ocean Puzzle, didn't it?

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.850
So does this mean you have the
means to finish the Black Wind?

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:34.320
"Do I have the means to finish him," he asks!

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:40.400
You're asking me, Pist, one of the Four Lords
of Gaudium, the ruler of the sea?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.390
There is no way I can fail!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.680
Your days of having to deal with
these incompetent fools are over.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.080
You're getting too big for your britches!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.510
I'm going to totally Hughug you to death!

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:56.180
I have already taken the pleasure
of analyzing the data

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.410
that Crux has collected thus far on that man.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.620
I have become aware of his weakness.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.790
Or so he says.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.260
Lord Makenshi is no longer needed.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.330
How could you say something like that?!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.640
Is that okay with you, Makenshi baby?!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:23.140
Shall I go ahead and prove what I say is true?

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.040
I wouldn't mind seeing that at all.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.680
Don't be scared to use your
great Summon technique.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.590
That's it!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:00.100
The source of all Makenshi's power is that Mist.

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:05.040
So it's quite simple. All I have to do is
entrap the Mist before it can be used.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.120
If you know your enemy and work out a plan,

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:14.590
there is no one in the entire universe
who you need to fear.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.470
Oh yes, that's right!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:21.500
It's not like you guys have been totally useless.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:26.100
The data from your losses
has been incredibly effective.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:31.140
I've already formed the perfect plan
to use against the Black Wind.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.750
I'm looking forward to this, Pist.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.980
Just kick back and relax, Your Excellency.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:57.030
Gaudium is so lively now that
Lord Pist has returned.

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:01.700
We're counting on you, Lord Pist.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:14.180
Such a strange energy, almost like
there are a lot of people around.

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.760
This is not just normal sand.

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:36.270
You guys don't think that I'm weird?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:38.970
Not at all.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.880
It would be so cool if I could
change form just like you.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.750
I think if you could change, it'd be into a lion.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.650
What do you mean by that?!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.280
Yeah, I guess you guys are right.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.290
Kaze!

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.000
We finally meet again!

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:19.610
I've been looking, but I had no idea
I would get to meet you so soon.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.720
Is it fate?

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:38.660
Get down!

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.880
There is that great reaction speed
that I expected!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.380
However!

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.990
You are falling right in line with the
predictions made from the data.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.950
Taking care of you guys should be no sweat!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.860
Is he one of the Earl's henchmen?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.030
My name is Pist.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:10.370
You should feel honored to know
that these hands will put an end...

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:15.870
You're not going to wait for me
to finish introducing myself?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:23.450
What do you think you're going
to do to me with that little gun?

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:28.780
Is something wrong with the Magun?
Why don't you use it?

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:31.450
We should get away from them.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.430
It has moved!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.260
Soil is my power!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.710
Have you noticed?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.240
This place is full of sand
of various properties.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:02.720
That's right, this unique place
is overflowing with Soil!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.960
Go ahead and shoot!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:09.060
It will be the last thing you ever do.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.100
What is this spirit? Is the Soil going crazy?

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:17.940
Isn't there something that we can do
to help Mr. Kaze in his fight?!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.970
Kaze...

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.970
Take care of him, Mister!

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:35.350
You're mine! Sand Gum!

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:01.180
I've just taken the Magun from you, Black Wind!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.290
I have effectively caught you
with my plan, haven't I?

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:15.750
What are you doing, Mister?!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.860
He took the Magun.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.770
Mr. Kaze...

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:25.610
The inorganic monsters, called Sand
Gum, that live in the Soil here

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:29.170
are able to change the shapes
of their bodies at will.

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:33.610
They made for a most ideal means
with which to capture the Magun.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.820
Just as I have planned,

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:40.340
your odds of winning are now zero!

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:45.260
If you grovel before me, I'll be kind
enough to make you a gravestone.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.560
Mr. Kaze is going to get slaughtered!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.120
Loan me a mirror, quick!

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:56.470
Gotcha! Poshepocket...

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.870
That's a dental mirror.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.750
Mr. Kaze, I'm coming to help you!

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.460
What?!

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:42.610
I fart bigger than that!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:45.710
Oh, no!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.380
They all disappeared, along with the Black Wind!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.160
Underground?

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.490
How clever of them.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.490
Crux!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.800
Go search for them.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.570
They shouldn't have gone far.

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:11.710
Who was that girl? She wasn't
included in my data.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:15.740
But the Magun is mine!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.150
Victory is already in my hands!

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.490
Are we safe?!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.020
Are you guys all right?

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.940
Mr. Kaze...

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.720
How was that guy able to take
the Magun so easily?

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:54.380
Maybe Mister is not as strong as we thought.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.560
Is that what you call an escape?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.390
Oh, no!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.200
I'm going to borrow this!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.500
Lou!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:12.400
Give me strength once more!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:16.540
My mirror!

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.210
You're not going to get me with that again!

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:26.480
Not so fast!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.190
I have analyzed that attack of yours.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.460
You'll never be able to use it in
the midst of this sandstorm.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:40.830
Lisa!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:41.900
Lou!

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.910
The Soil is too soft.

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.970
You didn't end up flying far enough.

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:57.950
Poshepocket!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.390
Lisa!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.390
Trapped in the Sand Gum like that,

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.130
you will now suffocate and die!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:17.970
I hate you! Why are you always doing this?!

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:21.040
I'll bet it's you guys who are sending
Omega out on his rampage!

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:22.710
Omega?

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.680
Are you saying that Omega
has been revived?

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:28.940
Don't pretend like you don't know!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.880
If that is true,

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.120
I don't have time to worry about you chumps.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.720
I'm going to finish this once and for all!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.560
You cannot defeat me with such a weak gun.

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:51.560
Is something wrong with the Magun?
Why don't you use it?

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.600
What are you saying!?

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:57.170
Are you crazy?!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:59.180
Have you lost your mind, Black Wind?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.680
Very well!

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:05.620
Then view the fruits of my research.

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:09.790
There is plenty of Soil around here.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:13.160
I shall blend it to form
the ultimate Summon!

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.960
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:30.310
The glare of obvious intelligence,
Marvelous Orange!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.640
What do you plan on doing?!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:41.190
The desire of an endless quest,
Maniac Purple!

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:45.760
Kaze!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:50.390
And finally, promise of a perfect
victory, Ultra-Shocking Pink!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:58.670
This is it, the perfect, undefeatable combination!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:01.870
Howl, Magun! Go with the flow of the Soil!

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:10.280
Come, the Ultimate Summon!

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.850
What the hell?!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.530
The Sand Gum has...

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.640
That's...

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:04.270
The Magun is my very life.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.440
None other may fire it.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.940
Mr. Kaze is so cool!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.180
Kaze really is amazing.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:23.650
I'm a little scared of all this.

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:25.790
That power...

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:36.070
Pist, was that the plan
you were so confident about?

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.940
Not quite.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:43.910
This time was just a test to investigate
the Magun's critical energy point.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.510
I was able to record the correct data.

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.520
You're bluffing!

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:53.540
That's just an excuse for why you
didn't defeat the Black Wind.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.750
I could care less about that man.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:01.300
Leaving that aside, Your Excellency,

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:06.060
I have gathered data showing that
a part of Omega has awakened.

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:11.000
Omega?!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.640
I will begin calculating the
accurate position of Omega,

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:18.740
but it appears that he is in the Subway tunnel.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.810
Oh, he's in the dimensional tunnel.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:25.580
That's why we haven't been able
to find him until now.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.980
We can always count on you, Lord Pist.

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.230
Don't mention it.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.520
It is easy for someone as great as myself.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:41.460
Find him! Immediately!

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.300
Omega will be mine!

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.160
Omega!

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:19.490
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.760
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:28.910
Work... Work... Work...

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.670
Those who are satisfied if they are
